Data of other origin
--------------------

This repository embeds the following reference data, with their sources:

- Material compositions and densities (data/materials.gci) from
  R. J. McConn Jr., C. J. Gesh, R. T. Pagh, R. A. Rucker, R. G. Williams III,
  "Compendium of Material Composition Data for Radiation Transport Modeling",
  PNNL-15870 Rev. 1, Pacific Northwest National Laboratory, 2011.
- Mean excitation energies of the elements (crates/guaraci-core/src/electron.rs)
  from ICRU Report 37, "Stopping Powers for Electrons and Positrons",
  International Commission on Radiation Units and Measurements, 1984.
- Reference values used in the validation tests and tables (NIST XCOM and
  ESTAR; M. G. Stabin and M. W. Konijnenberg, J Nucl Med 2000;41:149-160),
  cited where they are used.

Nuclear and atomic data libraries (ENDF/B-VIII.0 and others) are NOT
redistributed: Guaraci downloads them from their official sources on the
user's machine, checks their SHA-256 and converts them locally.

